  "body": "What's new in 0.3.0:\n\n- **Liquid Glass theme**: the accent colour at full strength as a wallpaper of 3D ribbons, with clear frosted glass panels, bright rims, glass cards, buttons and switches. Dialogs frost properly.\n- **Windows updates install**: the installer runs silently, the app restarts by itself, and a log is kept in %TEMP%. Update notes show only what changed.\n- The theme button moved from the toolbar into Settings → Appearance.\n\n\n> **Windows:** versions before this one could not finish an update by themselves. Install this version once from the files below; after that, updates install from inside the app.\n",
